WEBVTT

00:41.662 --> 00:44.289
I think you've had too much to drink.

00:44.289 --> 00:46.867
Let's wrap up the meeting here.

00:46.867 --> 00:49.135
I'll follow up later.

00:50.462 --> 00:51.527
Hey, where are you going?

00:51.527 --> 00:53.292
That hurts. Let go!

00:53.292 --> 00:55.107
You're just going to walk away like that?

00:55.107 --> 00:58.102
Please let go of my hand! That hurts!

01:01.598 --> 01:02.906
Tae Seop?

01:02.906 --> 01:04.142
Who the hell are you?

01:04.142 --> 01:05.185
Me?

01:05.185 --> 01:07.354
Her boyfriend.

01:09.834 --> 01:11.233
- You all right?
- Yeah.

01:11.233 --> 01:13.276
Hold on, what's going on?

01:13.276 --> 01:15.786
You had a boyfriend?

01:17.948 --> 01:20.876
They set up a girl who already had a boyfriend?

01:20.876 --> 01:24.079
A date?

01:24.079 --> 01:26.630
Who set this up?

01:28.417 --> 01:29.652
I knew something felt wrong.

01:29.652 --> 01:32.932
I'm not letting this slide.

01:32.932 --> 01:35.371
Don't even think about our deal.

01:35.371 --> 01:37.676
Let's just call it a night.

01:37.676 --> 01:40.095
Why do you keep butting in?

01:40.095 --> 01:42.652
I think you'd prefer me over the cops.

01:42.652 --> 01:46.442
There are plenty of witnesses here.
The cameras are rolling too.

02:05.412 --> 02:08.123
Let's see how this goes for you.

02:08.123 --> 02:09.419
Are you okay?

02:09.419 --> 02:10.560
Oh, yeah.

02:10.560 --> 02:12.676
Does your wrist hurt? Let me see.

02:18.883 --> 02:20.789
- Oh, but...
- Yeah?

02:20.789 --> 02:22.920
How did you know to come here?

02:22.920 --> 02:24.963
Oh, it's...

02:24.963 --> 02:27.768
I got a call from Ji Su.

02:27.768 --> 02:29.186
Ji Su?

02:29.186 --> 02:30.770
Yeah.

02:34.906 --> 02:37.687
Another person keeps coming to mind.

02:37.687 --> 02:40.238
I'll keep my distance

02:40.238 --> 02:41.666
and not make things awkward.

02:41.666 --> 02:43.369
Yeah?

03:12.792 --> 03:14.819
How could I not see this coming?

03:14.819 --> 03:17.867
Don't blame yourself. You should be angry.

03:19.611 --> 03:22.573
Let's go. I'll take you home.

03:39.297 --> 03:43.159
[Episode 10]

03:43.927 --> 03:45.834
The team manager sent you on purpose.

03:45.834 --> 03:47.434
The whole thing was a blind date.

03:47.434 --> 03:50.623
Looks like that guy showed up knowing it all.

03:51.777 --> 03:53.459
- Here, feel this.
- Sorry?

03:53.459 --> 03:54.479
No, I'm okay.

03:54.479 --> 03:56.083
You're old enough to know how this works.

03:56.083 --> 03:58.233
When you keep acting like
you don't know anything,

03:58.233 --> 03:59.914
it kills the mood.

03:59.914 --> 04:01.861
So how many guys have you dated?

04:01.861 --> 04:04.413
Three? Four?

04:05.031 --> 04:07.194
But why would the manager do this?

04:07.194 --> 04:09.000
The executive had his eye on it,

04:09.000 --> 04:10.914
so he just pushed it through.

04:10.914 --> 04:13.726
He figured a single meal wouldn't matter.

04:13.726 --> 04:16.627
So, you've been going on
a lot of blind dates lately, right?

04:16.627 --> 04:20.947
Even if nothing comes of it,
it's all experience.

04:20.947 --> 04:23.299
And if one works out, that's a jackpot.

04:23.299 --> 04:24.806
Here, take this.

04:24.806 --> 04:28.938
Go enjoy something nice, alright?

04:31.792 --> 04:33.435
Even so,

04:33.435 --> 04:35.935
how can he do this with work?

04:35.935 --> 04:38.914
Hey. I won't overlook this either.

04:38.914 --> 04:41.154
He totally dismissed what we can do.

04:41.154 --> 04:44.328
I'll raise it officially with the company.

04:57.083 --> 04:59.301
[Livestock Supplier Directory]

05:00.044 --> 05:01.606
[F&B Park Si Eun, Purchasing in chaos?]

05:02.422 --> 05:03.715
[PR Jung Se Yeon, Why? What happened?]

05:03.715 --> 05:04.883
[F&B Park Si Eun,
Manager and staff had a huge fight?]

05:04.883 --> 05:08.102
Like things aren't stressful enough.

05:08.720 --> 05:11.689
There's never a quiet day for me.

05:35.417 --> 05:37.123
How did it go?

05:37.123 --> 05:39.704
I just told them everything.

05:39.704 --> 05:42.170
The project handoff out of nowhere,

05:42.170 --> 05:44.840
everything Ui Yeong dealt with.
The whole thing.

05:44.840 --> 05:49.268
The manager's with HR Compliance Team now.

05:51.542 --> 05:54.064
Let's grab some coffee.

06:24.087 --> 06:25.338
Ui Yeong.

06:25.338 --> 06:27.139
Sir.

06:28.709 --> 06:30.885
Well...

06:30.885 --> 06:32.917
I'm sorry.

06:32.917 --> 06:36.057
I figured

06:36.057 --> 06:40.694
if the working-level staff bonded,
it'd smooth things over...

06:41.917 --> 06:45.115
No, that's no excuse.

06:45.997 --> 06:48.417
This was my mistake.

06:48.417 --> 06:49.445
Completely.

06:49.445 --> 06:51.872
It won't happen again.

06:52.637 --> 06:54.784
You have my word.

06:54.784 --> 06:57.248
Understood.

06:57.248 --> 06:59.194
I'm sorry.

07:23.730 --> 07:26.984
[General Manager Eun Jeong Seok]
Haven't had lunch yet?

07:36.333 --> 07:38.083
Chef's special for two, please.

07:38.083 --> 07:41.130
- Right away.
- Thank you.

07:42.250 --> 07:43.583
You know...

07:43.583 --> 07:47.170
Maybe I should've switched clothes.

07:47.170 --> 07:49.047
Oh, don't worry about it.

07:49.047 --> 07:51.598
We're customers right now.

07:51.598 --> 07:53.709
Besides, this restaurant
isn't run by the hotel.

07:53.709 --> 07:56.318
It's a vendor.
There's no staff discount either.

07:56.318 --> 07:57.472
So don't hold back.

07:57.472 --> 08:00.441
Let's just enjoy this.

08:07.326 --> 08:09.239
This is one fancy lunch.

08:09.239 --> 08:12.619
Rough times deserve proper consolation.

08:12.619 --> 08:15.090
Please, eat.

08:15.090 --> 08:17.283
You were giving your all for this hotel,

08:17.283 --> 08:20.709
and we neglected someone important.

08:20.709 --> 08:23.589
- I apologize.
- Oh, please.

08:24.999 --> 08:27.250
I've received an apology,

08:27.250 --> 08:29.499
plus all this generous support.

08:29.499 --> 08:32.834
It won't be a completely bitter memory.

08:32.834 --> 08:34.499
Yeah.

08:36.771 --> 08:41.231
It's been roughly ten years
since you joined The Hills, hasn't it?

08:42.100 --> 08:44.030
Yes.

08:44.030 --> 08:47.292
If you just let things slide,

08:47.292 --> 08:49.667
you'll hit a wall with this company.

08:49.667 --> 08:54.018
So until the disciplinary process is settled,

08:54.018 --> 08:58.210
I'm thinking of giving you some leave.

08:58.210 --> 09:00.576
Oh, a vacation?

09:00.576 --> 09:03.542
But I've got suppliers to track down.

09:03.542 --> 09:05.790
There's a ton on my plate.

09:05.790 --> 09:09.528
I expected you to be happy.

09:09.528 --> 09:12.249
Now that I think about it,
you've never properly rested.

09:12.249 --> 09:15.508
Finished university without a single break too.

09:15.508 --> 09:16.568
That's right.

09:16.568 --> 09:18.625
It's impressive,

09:18.625 --> 09:21.313
but it makes me feel for you.

09:22.333 --> 09:25.709
Na Ri's fired up and ready,
so let her handle things.

09:25.709 --> 09:28.020
Take this chance

09:28.020 --> 09:32.575
to look after yourself for once.

09:36.500 --> 09:39.073
All right. I'll do that.

09:39.073 --> 09:40.517
Good. Now dig in.

09:40.517 --> 09:43.961
- The soup is really good.
- Thanks. I'll enjoy it.

09:53.709 --> 09:56.037
- Morning, Mom.
- How come you're still in your pajamas?

09:56.037 --> 09:57.156
No work today?

09:57.156 --> 09:59.316
Oh, they gave me a break.

09:59.316 --> 10:01.776
My body still thinks it's a workday though.

10:01.776 --> 10:03.681
Out of nowhere?

10:03.681 --> 10:04.797
Did you get in trouble?

10:04.797 --> 10:06.518
More like something happened to me...

10:06.518 --> 10:10.312
They just told me to recharge.

10:10.312 --> 10:12.792
I've always told you,

10:12.792 --> 10:16.111
say no when you need to and don't hold back.

10:16.111 --> 10:18.070
You give me the hardest time, Mom.

10:18.070 --> 10:21.752
- Enough lecturing. Go to work already.
- Fine.

10:21.752 --> 10:23.472
Tidy up while I'm out.

10:23.472 --> 10:24.958
Housework doesn't take vacations.

10:24.958 --> 10:25.995
Oh my.

10:25.995 --> 10:27.313
What are you planning to do then?

10:27.313 --> 10:29.081
You're overthinking it. I'll find plenty to do.

10:29.081 --> 10:30.973
- Get going.
- I'm heading out.

10:30.973 --> 10:33.510
- See you later.
- Bye.

10:34.587 --> 10:36.423
What do I do?

10:40.667 --> 10:42.481
Nothing to do.

10:42.481 --> 10:44.819
I can't believe I came here on my own.

10:45.417 --> 10:48.518
I got slammed with work this morning.

10:48.518 --> 10:51.778
Oh no. Think this might help?

10:56.317 --> 10:59.196
I need a forearm shot for energy?

11:03.116 --> 11:05.761
Shoot your face or your arm.

11:05.761 --> 11:09.046
You can't get it all in one frame.

11:14.418 --> 11:17.721
[I need a forearm shot for energy?]

11:19.208 --> 11:21.767
Now that gives me strength!

11:29.658 --> 11:32.419
Hyun Min, any luck at the market?

11:32.419 --> 11:33.688
Nothing came of it.

11:33.688 --> 11:36.357
But the journalist
from the Chikso piece replied.

11:36.357 --> 11:38.759
I could get the vendor details mentioned in it.

11:38.759 --> 11:39.903
From a journalist?

11:39.903 --> 11:40.945
Hang on.

11:40.945 --> 11:43.250
How come the 1s are all vanishing?

11:43.250 --> 11:45.538
Ui Yeong, you're checking our messages!

11:45.538 --> 11:48.494
- We're out. Starting a fresh chat.
- Wait, don't!

11:48.494 --> 11:51.205
Come on... Seriously...

11:51.205 --> 11:54.835
Make up your mind. Work or relax.

11:54.835 --> 11:58.228
It's all going to land on me
when I return anyway.

11:58.228 --> 11:59.589
Never mind that.

11:59.589 --> 12:02.748
You've been pushing things aside.

12:02.748 --> 12:04.977
Start checking them off.

12:07.834 --> 12:09.599
Hold on, you're not even off duty.

12:09.599 --> 12:13.069
Where's the usual squat and lunge talk?

12:13.069 --> 12:15.834
Okay, stay down. Plank. Go.

12:15.834 --> 12:18.834
- Oh, come on.
- Lie flat. Leg raises. Go.

12:18.834 --> 12:20.834
Roll over. Obliques. Go.

12:20.834 --> 12:23.488
Go! Engage your core. Go!

12:23.488 --> 12:25.770
[Vacation Wish List, Slow morning,
Feed my soul, Mom time, Try something new]

12:25.770 --> 12:29.543
There's so much I've been postponing.

12:42.208 --> 12:43.287
A date.

12:43.287 --> 12:45.052
[Date with Tae Seop]

12:47.412 --> 12:48.429
Anything else?

12:48.429 --> 12:51.491
- I'm leaving now.
- Wait.

12:51.491 --> 12:53.331
This one's yours.

12:53.331 --> 12:55.468
What's this?

12:55.468 --> 12:56.809
- Thank you.
- Don't mention it.

12:56.809 --> 12:59.322
- Have a good day.
- See you.

13:09.834 --> 13:11.793
Smells amazing.

13:20.546 --> 13:24.373
[Vacation Wish List, Slow morning]

13:28.761 --> 13:32.607
[Vacation Wish List, Feed my soul]

13:40.685 --> 13:43.000
[Vacation Wish List, Mom time]
I hate anything that hurts.

13:43.000 --> 13:46.125
Mom, my colleague is such a wimp

13:46.125 --> 13:47.906
and even she said it was painless.

13:47.906 --> 13:50.491
You need some skincare too.

13:50.491 --> 13:53.471
Then why don't you get it yourself?

13:53.471 --> 13:56.379
Let me do something nice for you.

14:03.333 --> 14:05.958
If you get sleepy, feel free to nap.

14:05.958 --> 14:07.599
Okay.

14:09.417 --> 14:12.145
How is it? Everything okay?

14:15.808 --> 14:20.048
[Vacation Wish List, Full-body stretch]

14:20.048 --> 14:23.550
Slow. Take it slow.

14:24.859 --> 14:25.942
Oh, stop there.

14:25.942 --> 14:28.529
Oh my, for a young person.

14:28.529 --> 14:29.948
It hurts.

14:29.948 --> 14:32.457
- Like this.
- How?

14:35.746 --> 14:37.614
[Park Jeong Im]

14:40.875 --> 14:42.000
- Hey.
- Yeah.

14:42.000 --> 14:45.379
Why aren't you eating with us lately?

14:45.379 --> 14:47.346
My daughter's off work right now

14:47.346 --> 14:50.217
and she's gotten hooked on cooking,

14:50.217 --> 14:52.277
so she's been packing my meals.

14:52.277 --> 14:54.250
She packs lunches while on vacation?

14:54.250 --> 14:56.158
What a wonderful daughter.

14:56.158 --> 15:00.144
Oh, you wouldn't say that after a bite.

15:00.144 --> 15:01.876
Have you scheduled your health screening?

15:01.876 --> 15:04.173
Oh, that's right.

15:04.173 --> 15:06.933
Want to do ours together again this year?

15:07.526 --> 15:09.533
I know this sounds like showing off,

15:09.533 --> 15:12.274
but my son wanted to go with me,
so it's already set.

15:12.274 --> 15:14.034
We're doing a buffet afterward.

15:14.034 --> 15:16.285
- That's quite the outing.
- Yeah.

15:16.285 --> 15:18.955
Take your daughter along.

15:18.955 --> 15:20.573
It's much less dull that way.

15:20.573 --> 15:21.792
Me?

15:21.792 --> 15:23.974
I'm fine. I'll just go alone.

15:23.974 --> 15:26.917
She's always fussing over something.

15:26.917 --> 15:29.055
Seems really occupied.

15:32.709 --> 15:34.690
- I'm painting this?
- Yeah.

15:34.690 --> 15:36.625
What if I ruin it?

15:36.625 --> 15:39.458
It's fine. I'll walk you through it.

15:39.458 --> 15:41.860
Just see how I do it first.

15:42.958 --> 15:46.524
Simply smooth it on like this.

15:46.524 --> 15:48.929
- Go ahead.
- This seems exciting.

15:48.929 --> 15:50.292
One second.

15:50.292 --> 15:52.588
You should tie your hair back.

15:53.500 --> 15:55.999
I'll do it for you.

15:57.118 --> 15:58.536
Can you actually do a ponytail?

15:58.536 --> 16:00.247
No.

16:01.000 --> 16:02.797
Like this.

16:05.250 --> 16:07.068
All done.

16:08.167 --> 16:09.881
- Let me try now.
- Sure.

16:09.881 --> 16:11.925
Dab it on like this.

16:16.804 --> 16:19.391
- Like this?
- Yeah, just spread it out.

16:20.934 --> 16:22.732
Nice work.

16:22.732 --> 16:25.375
[Date with Tae Seop]
I think I did it better.

16:25.375 --> 16:28.160
- You've got a real knack for this.
- I'm enjoying this.

16:28.160 --> 16:30.601
You seem completely adjusted to time off now.

16:30.601 --> 16:32.406
No mention of the office?

16:32.406 --> 16:35.531
There's no way work crosses my mind here.

16:35.531 --> 16:38.560
Working with wood is sort of meditative.

16:38.560 --> 16:40.661
When you concentrate, the noise just stops.

16:40.661 --> 16:42.461
Oh, I can really feel that.

16:42.461 --> 16:43.740
Right?

16:43.740 --> 16:45.124
You're seriously skilled at this.

16:45.124 --> 16:46.792
I think I have a genuine gift, honestly.

16:46.792 --> 16:48.472
Yeah.

16:50.041 --> 16:54.140
Leave it in a shady place
like that for a day or so.

17:01.141 --> 17:03.225
There's something I brought for you.

17:03.225 --> 17:06.061
What is that?

17:06.061 --> 17:08.071
It's a photo.

17:09.648 --> 17:13.584
Let's swap it
for that childhood picture of yours

17:13.584 --> 17:16.406
- I've had my eye on.
- Sure.

17:16.406 --> 17:20.008
You were beautiful from the start.

17:20.008 --> 17:22.287
Is this from a trip to the ocean?

17:22.287 --> 17:25.292
Yeah. I was around seven or eight.

17:25.292 --> 17:29.467
My mom and dad took me on summer vacation.

17:29.467 --> 17:30.709
That was probably

17:30.709 --> 17:33.847
the final trip the three of us
went on together.

17:35.375 --> 17:37.249
I'm sure

17:37.249 --> 17:41.958
it was cozy and bright and lovely,

17:41.958 --> 17:44.099
but only those snapshots are vivid.

17:44.099 --> 17:46.185
Everything else is a blur.

17:46.185 --> 17:49.308
As a child, you don't grasp
how rare those moments are.

17:49.308 --> 17:50.356
Exactly.

17:50.356 --> 17:55.047
If it were today, I'd cherish every moment.

17:55.047 --> 17:58.079
Too deeply to ever let it go.

17:59.449 --> 18:01.624
Even now.

18:01.624 --> 18:04.671
- This counts too?
- Yeah.

18:04.671 --> 18:06.478
This time off just fell into my lap,

18:06.478 --> 18:08.749
and with the excuse
of doing things I've never done,

18:08.749 --> 18:11.512
here I am hovering next to you.

18:11.512 --> 18:13.004
Will days like this come often?

18:13.004 --> 18:16.312
You're right. This is truly special.

18:16.312 --> 18:18.475
Yeah, it really is.

18:22.876 --> 18:25.125
I look better now, right?

18:25.125 --> 18:27.373
I don't think so.

18:47.083 --> 18:49.040
Gosh. What?

18:49.040 --> 18:51.584
I emailed you yesterday
and texted today asking you to stop by.

18:51.584 --> 18:54.587
No reply, so here I am.

18:54.587 --> 18:56.265
Take a look.

18:57.651 --> 18:59.892
I'm sorry.

18:59.892 --> 19:04.709
I've been totally buried lately.

19:04.709 --> 19:07.066
But the agreement's nearly wrapped up

19:07.066 --> 19:11.046
and the gift set is coming along nicely.

19:11.729 --> 19:13.052
Keep it up.

19:13.052 --> 19:15.167
The weekend's right around the corner.

19:15.167 --> 19:16.567
Yeah.

19:16.567 --> 19:18.584
Nearly the weekend.

19:18.584 --> 19:19.611
The weekend.

19:19.611 --> 19:22.122
Hey, Chef.

19:25.075 --> 19:27.000
Hey.

19:27.000 --> 19:28.203
Yeah?

19:28.203 --> 19:32.000
I need you at the Chikso ranch this weekend.

19:32.000 --> 19:34.172
Excuse me?

19:34.172 --> 19:36.673
Sorry. We just don't have enough time.

19:36.673 --> 19:37.876
Head out, do the on-site review,

19:37.876 --> 19:39.924
and come back with the signed deal.

19:39.924 --> 19:42.053
Hold on, Mrs. Na Ri,

19:42.053 --> 19:45.679
you hand me a weekend off, then snatch it away?

19:45.679 --> 19:48.307
I won't be relaxing either.

19:48.307 --> 19:51.000
I'll take care of the rest,

19:51.000 --> 19:53.020
so just cover the ranch for me.

19:53.020 --> 19:54.815
Okay.

19:57.066 --> 20:00.208
Oh, Ui Yeong.

20:00.208 --> 20:02.328
I miss you.

20:04.742 --> 20:07.200
Ui Yeong!

20:09.821 --> 20:11.455
How've you been?

20:11.455 --> 20:14.401
How are you? I've been dying to see you.

20:14.401 --> 20:16.068
It hasn't been that long.

20:16.068 --> 20:18.388
Were you my entire world?

20:18.388 --> 20:21.542
I only realized how much
you mattered after you left.

20:21.542 --> 20:24.969
Let's go. A spot I chose especially for you.

20:24.969 --> 20:27.979
Oh, can't wait. Let's check it out.

20:29.000 --> 20:31.515
After you.

20:31.515 --> 20:34.436
That's a huge portion! I'll enjoy this.

20:34.436 --> 20:36.696
- Dig in.
- Thanks.

20:44.155 --> 20:45.195
This is so good.

20:45.195 --> 20:48.166
Right? I said it'd be great.

20:51.000 --> 20:55.841
But you didn't call me just to eat, did you?

20:55.841 --> 20:59.325
I had no idea
your absence would feel this huge.

20:59.325 --> 21:03.525
I've literally been doing nothing
but work nonstop.

21:03.525 --> 21:06.760
I'm separated from my fresh new boyfriend too.

21:06.760 --> 21:09.096
I have to go to the Chikso ranch
this weekend for a site review

21:09.096 --> 21:12.099
and bring back the signed agreement,

21:12.099 --> 21:14.226
but I've never handled a contract solo before.

21:14.226 --> 21:16.353
I was hoping to get your advice.

21:16.353 --> 21:17.564
Where is it?

21:17.564 --> 21:19.825
Sokcho, Gangwon-do.

21:19.825 --> 21:21.699
Sokcho...

21:22.359 --> 21:24.285
Should I tag along?

21:25.233 --> 21:26.236
Seriously?

21:26.236 --> 21:28.450
You treated me to a good meal,

21:28.450 --> 21:31.235
and I need a getaway anyway.

21:31.235 --> 21:34.125
Oh, that would be wonderful.

21:34.125 --> 21:38.792
I'll arrange the stay and ride,
so just show up.

21:38.792 --> 21:41.635
Whatever time is left is yours.
I won't bother you one bit.

21:41.635 --> 21:43.455
Okay. Let's go together.

21:43.455 --> 21:46.175
You're my angel.

21:46.175 --> 21:48.750
- Have some more.
- Yeah.

21:48.750 --> 21:51.180
I'm home.

21:51.180 --> 21:52.435
Where were you?

21:52.435 --> 21:55.066
I met up with a coworker.

21:56.244 --> 21:58.884
What's this, you're getting a checkup?

21:58.884 --> 22:00.502
Yeah.

22:01.440 --> 22:05.360
Got plans this weekend? Want to see a film?

22:05.360 --> 22:07.045
Oh, Mom, that won't work.

22:07.045 --> 22:09.644
I have to head to Sokcho
to finalize a contract with a vendor.

22:09.644 --> 22:13.243
My colleague doesn't feel
comfortable on her own.

22:13.243 --> 22:15.958
The final weekend of your time off?

22:15.958 --> 22:18.664
Well, at least you won't dread going back.

22:18.664 --> 22:20.084
Right.

22:20.084 --> 22:24.095
So this is how my break wraps up.

22:29.259 --> 22:36.390
[HKUH Cancer Center Donation Ceremony]

22:36.390 --> 22:39.353
We'll be handing out certificates
to our top donors today,

22:39.353 --> 22:41.019
then a group photo,

22:41.019 --> 22:42.648
followed by the press release going out.

22:42.648 --> 22:45.901
But I noticed my wife's missing from the list?

22:45.901 --> 22:48.363
Didn't she reach out to you?

22:48.363 --> 22:51.114
Your wife confirmed
the donation will proceed as arranged,

22:51.114 --> 22:54.208
but she called to say she won't be here.

22:59.374 --> 23:02.331
- I see.
- Yes.

23:11.677 --> 23:14.000
[Director Shin Ji Hoon]
The person you are calling is not answering.

23:14.000 --> 23:18.024
Please record your message after the tone.

23:21.228 --> 23:25.253
[Son Jeong A]

23:28.944 --> 23:33.206
So it's clear she's avoiding my calls.

23:34.917 --> 23:36.584
Come in.

23:41.966 --> 23:43.759
Just leave those.

23:55.888 --> 23:57.261
[Seoul Family Court]

24:08.984 --> 24:11.445
[Seoul Family Court]

24:11.445 --> 24:12.972
[Complaint]

24:15.115 --> 24:16.346
[Plaintiff, Son Jeong A,
Defendant, Shin Ji Hoon]

24:16.346 --> 24:17.728
[Divorce and Alimony Claim]

24:23.431 --> 24:25.842
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

24:27.458 --> 24:29.554
I'm sorry.

24:31.292 --> 24:33.057
Welcome.

24:34.083 --> 24:36.352
- Ji Su.
- Yes.

24:40.417 --> 24:43.685
I've been a big fan for years.

24:43.685 --> 24:44.742
May I have your autograph?

24:44.742 --> 24:47.181
Oh, absolutely. What's your name?

24:47.181 --> 24:48.275
Cheol.

24:48.275 --> 24:50.261
Song Cheol.

24:50.261 --> 24:52.363
Put today's date,

24:52.363 --> 24:55.163
and add "To Cheol" right here please.

24:55.917 --> 24:57.515
Thank you.

24:57.515 --> 25:00.235
Order whatever you want. It's on me.

25:00.235 --> 25:03.379
Ji Su, don't charge her, okay?

25:09.292 --> 25:12.764
One hand drip, please. Make it hot.

25:19.361 --> 25:22.615
Isn't there anywhere else for coffee in Seoul?

25:22.615 --> 25:25.775
I thought you said no more crossing paths.

25:25.775 --> 25:27.873
I'm here because I need to tell you something.

25:27.873 --> 25:30.323
It's not the kind of thing
I'd put in a message.

25:31.943 --> 25:33.993
I don't care to hear it.

25:34.696 --> 25:35.993
So prickly.

25:35.993 --> 25:37.914
I...

25:37.914 --> 25:39.453
I'm ending my marriage.

25:39.453 --> 25:41.054
What?

25:49.417 --> 25:51.670
Do you mean that?

25:51.670 --> 25:55.293
Quite a response from someone who doesn't care.

25:55.293 --> 25:57.945
I'm keeping it under wraps.

25:57.945 --> 26:00.603
You carried on like it was
a once-in-a-lifetime love,

26:01.750 --> 26:04.205
and now you're walking away this easily?

26:04.205 --> 26:07.637
I wasn't picturing an empty ending
when I fell for him.

26:07.637 --> 26:09.779
I only learned recently

26:10.398 --> 26:13.449
that my relationship was built on lies.

26:14.069 --> 26:17.161
I looked at your mother's charts
with my own eyes.

26:18.645 --> 26:22.250
He started seeing me during her treatment.

26:24.709 --> 26:26.671
I had no idea.

26:27.686 --> 26:29.584
Or...

26:29.584 --> 26:32.000
maybe I just let myself stay blind.

26:32.000 --> 26:33.837
When you're completely consumed by love,

26:33.837 --> 26:36.375
the truth can bang on the door all it wants,

26:36.375 --> 26:37.906
and you still won't answer.

26:37.906 --> 26:41.513
A love that doesn't care the slightest
about others' suffering,

26:41.513 --> 26:43.521
isn't that revolting to you?

26:44.417 --> 26:46.107
And yet now,

26:46.958 --> 26:49.986
the truth has become impossible
to look away from.

26:52.149 --> 26:53.746
I'm sorry.

26:53.746 --> 26:55.859
After all this time?

26:55.859 --> 26:58.526
I'm sorry

26:58.526 --> 27:01.156
it took this long to tell you.

27:01.156 --> 27:03.040
I mean it.

27:21.584 --> 27:24.834
- Hello, Director.
- Hello.

27:24.834 --> 27:25.834
Hello, Director.

27:25.834 --> 27:27.724
- Hello.
- Hello.

27:27.724 --> 27:29.400
Hello.

27:30.808 --> 27:32.612
Hello.

27:36.024 --> 27:37.083
- Hey.
- Yes?

27:37.083 --> 27:39.248
Is that the styling we're giving him?

27:39.248 --> 27:42.072
That's a model, not a junior cop.

27:42.072 --> 27:46.083
I'll tell them to tone down the hair
and clothes a bit.

27:47.134 --> 27:49.206
Go to wardrobe in about ten minutes.

27:49.206 --> 27:50.752
Sure.

27:53.876 --> 27:57.963
So you're the one
Son Jeong A pulled strings for.

27:57.963 --> 27:59.056
I'm sorry?

27:59.056 --> 28:04.036
Word is she's already eyeing
a different project,

28:04.036 --> 28:06.471
planting her son before she pulls out.

28:06.471 --> 28:09.225
No wonder the director's upset.

28:10.917 --> 28:13.395
Good-looking though.

28:13.395 --> 28:16.815
You leave Saturday and come back Sunday?

28:16.815 --> 28:17.859
Yeah.

28:17.859 --> 28:21.236
After the ranch,
I'm exploring the surroundings.

28:21.236 --> 28:24.825
The shore in that picture
I showed you is close by.

28:24.825 --> 28:27.136
I'd love to go back after so long.

28:28.554 --> 28:31.102
What if I joined you?

28:31.102 --> 28:32.115
You'd come, Tae Seop?

28:32.115 --> 28:34.332
Your time off is nearly up,

28:34.332 --> 28:36.902
and even a quick trip together sounds lovely.

28:36.902 --> 28:40.497
Would I be a distraction from work?

28:41.408 --> 28:42.429
[Song Tae Seop]

28:43.458 --> 28:44.915
Absolutely not.

28:44.915 --> 28:47.515
We'd meet up once the work is finished.

28:47.515 --> 28:49.514
I'll head over when you're wrapped up.

28:49.514 --> 28:51.687
We'll watch the waves, grab great food,

28:51.687 --> 28:53.185
and take my car home together the next morning.

28:53.185 --> 28:55.000
That sounds perfect.

28:55.000 --> 28:57.314
I can't wait.

28:57.314 --> 28:59.532
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

29:04.208 --> 29:06.872
Our very first overnight trip?

29:10.747 --> 29:12.497
Mom, I'm leaving now.

29:12.497 --> 29:13.917
All right.

29:13.917 --> 29:16.716
- Just one night away, right?
- Yeah.

29:16.716 --> 29:18.716
Don't skip any meals,

29:18.716 --> 29:20.964
and go see a film or something.

29:20.964 --> 29:22.839
All right. Hurry up and go.

29:22.839 --> 29:25.975
- I'll be back.
- Bye.

29:29.792 --> 29:32.142
- Hyun Min.
- Ui Yeong!

29:32.142 --> 29:33.733
You're here?

29:36.000 --> 29:37.750
Thank you so much for coming with me.

29:37.750 --> 29:38.892
Oh, don't mention it.

29:38.892 --> 29:41.500
I get to enjoy the ocean breeze too.

29:42.275 --> 29:44.613
Then let's go in travel mode. Let's go!

29:44.613 --> 29:46.384
Let's go!

29:50.917 --> 29:54.579
- These are native Chikso from Gangwon-do.
- Right.

29:54.579 --> 29:56.999
The flesh is dense and excellent. Have a look.

29:56.999 --> 29:59.709
You can tell they're distinct
from standard breeds.

29:59.709 --> 30:01.280
Notice that dark pattern?

30:01.280 --> 30:03.709
That sets them apart from ordinary cattle too.

30:03.709 --> 30:06.383
- That one's native stock as well.
- Yes.

30:06.383 --> 30:08.677
[Livestock Artificial Insemination License]

30:08.677 --> 30:11.411
[Patent, Trademark Registration]

30:15.233 --> 30:18.000
Take a final look and put your signature.

30:18.000 --> 30:19.695
Of course.

30:22.524 --> 30:23.584
Dad.

30:23.584 --> 30:25.417
- Hey.
- What is it?

30:25.417 --> 30:27.697
This is my son. He helps me out.

30:27.697 --> 30:29.872
They're from the hotel.

30:31.542 --> 30:33.432
Hello.

30:33.432 --> 30:37.372
My dad is truly honest about his livestock.

30:37.372 --> 30:38.498
We hope for a great partnership.

30:38.498 --> 30:40.313
We'll give it our all on our end too.

30:40.313 --> 30:42.384
Thank you.

30:46.589 --> 30:49.086
[HANKUK UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL]

30:53.125 --> 30:55.350
Honey, you tired?

30:55.350 --> 30:57.208
- Oh, I'm...
- Yeah.

30:57.208 --> 30:58.709
I have zero energy.

30:58.709 --> 31:01.938
Oh no. What do you feel like eating after?

31:01.938 --> 31:03.751
How about some loach soup?

31:03.751 --> 31:05.609
I'd love that.

31:05.609 --> 31:07.027
- That place was delicious.
- Yeah.

31:07.027 --> 31:09.406
- Park Jeong Im.
- Yes.

31:09.406 --> 31:11.410
Please head to the MRI room.

31:11.410 --> 31:12.998
Okay.

31:14.333 --> 31:17.287
The rooms aren't adjacent to each other.

31:17.287 --> 31:18.451
Would that be okay?

31:18.451 --> 31:20.750
For adjacent rooms,

31:20.750 --> 31:22.784
we have a twin type available.

31:22.784 --> 31:23.886
That works.

31:23.886 --> 31:26.326
A double is the way to go, right?

31:26.326 --> 31:27.366
Absolutely.

31:27.366 --> 31:28.842
If we need each other, there's always texting.

31:28.842 --> 31:30.785
A wider bed is always a plus.

31:30.785 --> 31:33.561
- Yeah.
- I'll arrange those for you right away.

31:34.429 --> 31:35.466
Here.

31:35.466 --> 31:38.215
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

31:40.958 --> 31:43.565
Hyun Min, any plans for dinner?

31:43.565 --> 31:45.208
If it's okay with you...

31:45.208 --> 31:46.375
Ui Yeong,

31:46.375 --> 31:48.500
please don't mind me one bit.

31:48.500 --> 31:51.500
Enjoy the rest of your evening.

31:51.500 --> 31:53.372
Sure, then.

32:08.131 --> 32:09.633
Oh, Tae Seop!

32:09.633 --> 32:11.279
Ui Yeong.

32:13.426 --> 32:16.707
- Let's head to the beach first.
- I'd love that.

32:23.424 --> 32:24.792
Even at the playground?

32:24.792 --> 32:27.031
What's that? I'll buy you two.

32:30.091 --> 32:32.119
It's so beautiful.

32:56.428 --> 32:58.248
Like a mountain dusted with snow.

32:58.248 --> 32:59.889
- It does look like a peak.
- Yeah.

32:59.889 --> 33:03.226
- What kind of shell is this?
- I can hear it.

33:03.226 --> 33:05.321
The sound of the ocean.

33:08.690 --> 33:10.527
Ui Yeong.

33:42.208 --> 33:44.073
This is so nice.

33:44.073 --> 33:47.444
Does the beach look the same
as when you were little?

33:50.064 --> 33:52.876
Nothing seems different.

33:52.876 --> 33:55.500
The sea must never grow old.

33:55.500 --> 33:57.113
Exactly.

33:57.113 --> 33:58.417
That might be

33:58.417 --> 34:01.458
why staring at the water calms me down.

34:02.542 --> 34:05.500
Hold on, your feet are covered in sand.

34:05.500 --> 34:08.132
No big deal. I can shake it off.

34:10.121 --> 34:12.462
- That's what I like about you.
- What?

34:12.462 --> 34:14.589
What do you mean?

34:14.589 --> 34:17.175
When I'm out walking the pups,

34:17.175 --> 34:19.920
it doesn't matter
if their feet get soaked or muddy.

34:19.920 --> 34:23.300
They just charge toward whatever excites them.

34:23.300 --> 34:26.584
And there's nothing more lovable than that.

34:26.584 --> 34:28.000
That's

34:28.000 --> 34:30.028
exactly how you are.

34:31.083 --> 34:34.101
And I adore this about you.

34:34.101 --> 34:36.110
What?

34:36.110 --> 34:40.789
How you find even the smallest parts
of me lovely and endearing.

34:41.441 --> 34:43.368
It makes me

34:43.368 --> 34:46.837
want to open up even more to you.

34:48.498 --> 34:50.210
That's nice.

35:05.041 --> 35:07.709
The ranch owner told us about a sashimi spot.

35:07.709 --> 35:10.398
- Should we check it out?
- Sure.

35:10.398 --> 35:13.523
But what about Hyun Min for dinner?

35:13.523 --> 35:15.765
She hasn't read her messages yet,
so she must be asleep.

35:15.765 --> 35:17.572
What?

35:18.528 --> 35:20.458
Okay.

35:20.458 --> 35:22.206
Thank you.

35:34.167 --> 35:35.886
That looks amazing.

35:39.883 --> 35:42.367
[Closed early due to capacity]
Sorry, we're closed for today.

35:42.367 --> 35:44.347
- What?
- We only take 100 groups a day.

35:44.347 --> 35:45.584
Please come back tomorrow.

35:45.584 --> 35:47.584
We can't. We came all the way here

35:47.584 --> 35:49.876
and we're leaving tomorrow.

35:49.876 --> 35:51.777
I'm sorry.

35:54.492 --> 35:56.876
Oh, that's sad.

35:56.876 --> 35:58.107
How about we look for another place?

35:58.107 --> 35:59.447
I saw plenty of sashimi restaurants
on the drive.

35:59.447 --> 36:02.495
Can't help it. Let's go.

36:07.375 --> 36:10.208
- What is it?
- Tae Seop.

36:10.208 --> 36:12.464
I think there's still a way in.

36:24.260 --> 36:26.847
- Ui Yeong!
- I thought you were asleep.

36:26.847 --> 36:29.606
You snuck your boyfriend along?

36:30.709 --> 36:32.604
Seems like I'm not the only one

36:32.604 --> 36:34.320
who combined work with a getaway.

36:34.967 --> 36:38.167
That explains
the front desk moment earlier...

36:38.167 --> 36:39.791
Yeah...

36:41.125 --> 36:42.458
Wait a second.

36:42.458 --> 36:46.377
- So my Min is in the same team as Ui Yeong?
- Yeah.

36:46.377 --> 36:48.617
How does my Jun know Ui Yeong?

36:48.617 --> 36:50.917
Oh, my Min and my Jun...

36:50.917 --> 36:52.895
It's driving me crazy.

36:53.625 --> 36:56.800
I played a part in you two getting together.

36:58.208 --> 37:00.512
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

37:05.333 --> 37:09.038
- So you were the Chocolate Killer.
- Yeah.

37:09.806 --> 37:12.468
Let me make you a thank-you wrap.

37:12.468 --> 37:13.476
Forget the wrap.

37:13.476 --> 37:15.849
Just please don't fight
and be good to each other.

37:15.849 --> 37:19.108
And if you ever do fight,
don't you dare call me.

37:19.108 --> 37:21.283
I'll make sure that never happens.

37:23.375 --> 37:25.517
So cute.

37:25.517 --> 37:28.408
You've known each other that long,

37:28.408 --> 37:30.329
so what was Seung Jun like at university?

37:30.329 --> 37:33.842
Did he get a lot of attention?
Were girls chasing after him?

37:35.292 --> 37:38.500
He's only become a presentable person now.

37:38.500 --> 37:40.750
If you'd met him in his college days,

37:40.750 --> 37:43.513
you wouldn't have looked twice.

37:45.083 --> 37:46.595
Excuse me.

37:46.595 --> 37:50.333
- You were just as hopeless back then!
- Hey!

37:50.333 --> 37:53.266
Ui Yeong was incredibly on the ball back then.

37:53.266 --> 37:54.809
How to grab a spot at the library,

37:54.809 --> 37:56.436
where to find affordable coffee,

37:56.436 --> 37:59.125
how to register for housing lotteries,
things like that.

37:59.125 --> 38:02.199
We were purely partners in getting by.

38:02.199 --> 38:03.478
Right.

38:03.478 --> 38:07.155
That explains why you're so clever.

38:07.155 --> 38:11.112
You were such a good friend.

38:11.112 --> 38:12.125
Adorable.

38:12.125 --> 38:14.537
You're a cutie too.

38:14.537 --> 38:17.410
Here's a conch piece for you.

38:17.410 --> 38:20.626
Say ah.

38:20.626 --> 38:22.753
[Yeonggeum Sashimi]

38:22.753 --> 38:26.925
Okay then, round two, karaoke!

38:26.925 --> 38:27.967
What was that?

38:27.967 --> 38:29.262
Let's go back to the hotel.

38:29.262 --> 38:30.915
Is that okay?

38:30.915 --> 38:33.456
We'll stroll around a bit first.

38:33.456 --> 38:35.475
There's somewhere I'd like to visit.

38:35.475 --> 38:37.292
Where's that?

38:37.292 --> 38:39.536
- You're jabbing a hole through me.
- Yeah, go ahead.

38:39.536 --> 38:41.627
- We'll catch up in Seoul.
- See you next time.

38:41.627 --> 38:42.656
I'll call you.

38:42.656 --> 38:43.958
- Go.
- Go.

38:43.958 --> 38:45.355
Have a great night!

38:45.355 --> 38:47.197
You guys too.

38:48.845 --> 38:51.039
Those two look great together.

38:51.667 --> 38:53.458
Bye.

38:56.584 --> 38:59.186
Bye. Drive safe.

38:59.186 --> 39:01.133
Off you go.

39:04.128 --> 39:08.406
Isn't this peak fireworks territory for them?

39:08.406 --> 39:10.051
Like when they go in for a kiss,

39:10.051 --> 39:12.053
if you angle your head to the right,

39:12.053 --> 39:13.555
then I'll turn mine to the left,

39:13.555 --> 39:15.845
and we'll line everything up.

39:15.845 --> 39:17.517
You think that's how they'd do it?

39:17.517 --> 39:18.849
Right?

39:18.849 --> 39:21.609
I think the two of them are lovely.

39:21.609 --> 39:26.542
It's been ages since
I've watched her so loose and comfortable.

39:26.542 --> 39:29.333
Plus Tae Seop mentioned something before.

39:29.333 --> 39:30.729
- I'll get the check.
- Sure.

39:30.729 --> 39:32.831
Use this card, please.

39:36.250 --> 39:39.709
It's my first trip with Ui Yeong.

39:39.709 --> 39:42.294
I'd love to have some time
with just the two of us.

39:42.294 --> 39:44.629
Would it be okay
if we part ways after the meal?

39:44.629 --> 39:46.153
Oh, absolutely.

39:46.153 --> 39:49.667
Man to man, that kind of got to me.

39:49.667 --> 39:52.709
Now that's what a true gentleman looks like.

39:52.709 --> 39:54.345
Oh, you think so?

39:56.709 --> 39:58.099
Shall we?

39:58.099 --> 39:59.431
Let's go.

39:59.431 --> 40:01.217
Let's go.

40:04.814 --> 40:07.954
It's beautiful. Is this where you had in mind?

40:07.954 --> 40:09.826
I'm dying to ride it.

40:10.500 --> 40:12.989
They said the view's incredible,
but it's so tall.

40:12.989 --> 40:14.503
Yeah.

40:14.503 --> 40:17.500
We could just stand here and look.
That's perfectly...

40:17.500 --> 40:19.127
fine.

40:20.083 --> 40:23.904
The sea and the town are both spread out
right before your eyes.

40:23.904 --> 40:25.462
Incredible.

40:25.462 --> 40:28.803
It's all right there in a single glance.

40:28.803 --> 40:30.709
It'd be perfect

40:30.709 --> 40:32.851
if fireworks popped over that water right now.

40:32.851 --> 40:33.876
You know what I'm talking about?

40:33.876 --> 40:36.167
There's always someone
shooting fireworks by the shore.

40:36.167 --> 40:38.689
- Yeah, of course.
- Right.

40:42.127 --> 40:44.748
But you've been off for a while now.

40:44.748 --> 40:46.230
How so?

40:46.230 --> 40:49.125
Are you scared?

40:49.125 --> 40:52.458
No, I'm not scared at all.

40:52.458 --> 40:54.830
You look scared to me right now.

41:00.625 --> 41:02.796
- Here.
- What?

41:03.750 --> 41:06.800
Let me take your hand. Better now?

41:07.460 --> 41:08.500
Well...

41:08.500 --> 41:10.283
I don't think this is working.

41:16.208 --> 41:17.978
Keep your eyes on me.

41:18.898 --> 41:20.731
Not scared now, right?

41:25.096 --> 41:27.333
Not scared at all anymore.

41:32.709 --> 41:34.153
Try looking far away. Way out there.

41:34.153 --> 41:36.625
- Far? Where?
- Not up there.

41:36.625 --> 41:39.019
Look at the night view over there.

41:46.208 --> 41:47.541
I had no idea

41:47.541 --> 41:50.510
you reserved your own room.

41:51.796 --> 41:55.682
I figured you'd be sharing
a room with Hyun Min.

41:58.427 --> 42:00.854
I suppose that makes sense.

42:05.083 --> 42:07.027
They're so far apart.

42:07.846 --> 42:09.529
I know, right.

42:12.083 --> 42:14.777
Doors opening.

42:14.777 --> 42:17.758
Good night. I'll call you.

42:17.758 --> 42:19.472
Wait.

42:22.125 --> 42:24.338
I said I reserved another room.

42:24.338 --> 42:26.398
I never said we'd sleep apart.

42:26.398 --> 42:27.959
What?

42:30.000 --> 42:31.629
Let's

42:32.378 --> 42:34.554
be together tonight.

43:41.709 --> 43:44.700
- You're up?
- Yeah.

43:44.700 --> 43:46.770
We probably need to start packing up.

43:46.770 --> 43:49.504
No. I don't want to.

43:50.958 --> 43:53.133
A few more minutes.

43:55.834 --> 43:57.512
Just a tiny bit more.

43:59.584 --> 44:02.392
Nice.

44:04.333 --> 44:06.013
I seriously don't want to get up.

44:06.013 --> 44:07.625
We really need to head out.

44:07.625 --> 44:09.774
Let's stay just a bit longer.

44:36.470 --> 44:39.804
I'm coming downstairs.
I'll meet you at the front desk.

44:43.876 --> 44:46.561
Gosh.

44:47.432 --> 44:49.648
- You okay?
- Yeah.

44:51.333 --> 44:53.041
This is ripped.

44:53.041 --> 44:54.849
One moment.

44:55.710 --> 44:58.198
Do you have a spare bag?

45:02.667 --> 45:04.238
Here you go, sir.

45:04.238 --> 45:05.878
Oh, thank you.

45:05.878 --> 45:07.606
Not at all.

45:08.411 --> 45:10.289
Oh, Ui Yeong.

45:12.292 --> 45:14.748
- Oh, Dad.
- What?

45:14.748 --> 45:17.498
How did you end up here...

45:17.498 --> 45:19.962
Wait...

45:19.962 --> 45:21.717
Your dad?

45:21.717 --> 45:23.464
Yes.

45:25.317 --> 45:26.998
What?

45:29.847 --> 45:31.957
[Korea Railroad Corporation, Lee Tae Sung]

45:31.957 --> 45:34.302
What brings you here, Dad?

45:34.302 --> 45:35.962
I thought you were in Gyeongju.

45:35.962 --> 45:39.148
There's a new route launching nearby,

45:39.148 --> 45:41.601
plus a workshop today.

45:41.601 --> 45:45.112
So you two are here on a trip?

45:45.112 --> 45:46.441
No.

45:46.441 --> 45:49.755
I came here for work, and he tagged along.

45:49.755 --> 45:50.792
Right.

45:50.792 --> 45:52.581
What a day to be alive.

45:52.581 --> 45:55.623
Meeting my daughter's boyfriend in person.

45:55.623 --> 45:56.982
He wasn't planned.

45:56.982 --> 45:58.420
We bumped into each other.

45:58.420 --> 45:59.821
True.

45:59.821 --> 46:01.673
But that's even more unlikely.

46:01.673 --> 46:04.222
Maybe it's destiny?

46:06.971 --> 46:08.469
But,

46:08.469 --> 46:12.500
you didn't pick Tae Seop
because he resembles me, did you?

46:12.500 --> 46:13.709
- What?
- See.

46:13.709 --> 46:16.371
Tae Seop, Tae Sung.
The names almost match, right?

46:16.371 --> 46:17.686
There's a resemblance too.

46:17.686 --> 46:21.315
Petite face, nice complexion,
lengthy arms and legs.

46:21.315 --> 46:23.125
Gentle gaze.

46:23.125 --> 46:25.083
- Plus...
- Dad,

46:25.083 --> 46:27.670
you're exactly the same as always.

46:28.989 --> 46:31.331
Of course I'm the same.

46:31.331 --> 46:34.878
Even if you've all grown up,
you're still my little girl.

46:37.835 --> 46:40.895
Lately I keep reflecting on the old days.

46:40.895 --> 46:42.879
Because of trivial stuff,

46:42.879 --> 46:47.140
I feel like I let go of the moments
that truly counted.

46:47.755 --> 46:51.519
I should've been there for you and your mother,
no matter what.

46:54.667 --> 46:56.512
Oh, one second.

46:59.881 --> 47:01.615
I need to take off.

47:01.615 --> 47:03.408
Yeah.

47:05.734 --> 47:07.734
- Here, this is for you.
- No, I'm okay.

47:07.734 --> 47:10.494
- But you sent me fruit before.
- Honestly, it's fine.

47:10.494 --> 47:12.457
Really, you don't have to.

47:13.375 --> 47:14.703
Take it.

47:14.703 --> 47:15.911
Fill up at a gas station,

47:15.911 --> 47:18.755
and buy some chocolate, the kind my girl likes.

47:20.457 --> 47:22.337
Let's make time to meet more.

47:22.337 --> 47:25.178
I'll make a real effort, all right?

47:27.083 --> 47:29.302
- Take care.
- Okay.

47:29.302 --> 47:31.184
Please drive carefully.

47:49.417 --> 47:51.246
You all right?

47:53.625 --> 47:55.826
It's just strange.

47:55.826 --> 47:58.996
I'm completely stiff, but Dad treats me

47:58.996 --> 48:02.090
like we just spoke yesterday.

48:03.208 --> 48:07.679
Even so, your father strikes me
as a genuinely warm person.

48:08.268 --> 48:10.871
He always was.

48:10.871 --> 48:11.944
But

48:11.944 --> 48:14.730
we only saw each other on happy occasions,

48:14.730 --> 48:18.940
so perhaps that's the only side he got to show.

48:20.292 --> 48:22.509
Tell me about your mother.

48:22.509 --> 48:24.232
- My mom?
- Yeah.

48:24.232 --> 48:26.550
She's got one fierce personality.

48:28.125 --> 48:29.870
Level-headed,

48:29.870 --> 48:31.292
refuses to tolerate unfairness,

48:31.292 --> 48:33.913
and doesn't cut anyone slack, family included.

48:34.834 --> 48:38.008
They're such opposites,

48:38.008 --> 48:40.962
sharing a life must have been tough.

48:41.580 --> 48:45.133
But I honor what they decided.

48:47.917 --> 48:50.667
I had such a great time, thanks to you.

48:50.667 --> 48:52.348
Same here.

48:53.458 --> 48:55.677
I've only been places on business.

48:55.677 --> 48:58.139
A pure getaway like this

48:58.139 --> 49:00.621
has to be five or six years back for me.

49:00.621 --> 49:03.121
I normally just relax at home.

49:03.121 --> 49:06.340
I don't typically roam around by myself.

49:07.731 --> 49:09.866
Five or six years?

49:13.458 --> 49:17.074
So who did you go with that time?

49:17.074 --> 49:20.545
On our next break,
should we sync up our days off?

49:20.545 --> 49:21.871
I asked who you went with.

49:21.871 --> 49:23.405
- How about next month?
- The last trip.

49:23.405 --> 49:25.405
No, who was your last trip with?

49:25.405 --> 49:27.926
Would two months from now be better?

49:28.917 --> 49:31.007
I'll drop it this one time only.

49:31.007 --> 49:32.680
Thank you.

50:03.727 --> 50:06.000
Back to the office first thing tomorrow?

50:06.000 --> 50:08.250
It's not just work,

50:08.250 --> 50:11.003
spending every minute together
and then splitting up,

50:11.003 --> 50:12.971
it's so bittersweet.

50:13.630 --> 50:15.640
Well, before I leave...

50:19.625 --> 50:21.947
- That was so much fun.
- I don't want it to end.

50:21.947 --> 50:24.941
- Let's go on another trip soon.
- Yeah.

50:28.500 --> 50:29.667
Get home safe.

50:29.667 --> 50:31.401
Okay.

50:31.401 --> 50:32.986
Ui Yeong?

50:32.986 --> 50:34.292
Oh my, Mom.

50:34.292 --> 50:36.009
Your...

50:36.009 --> 50:37.209
This can't be happening.

50:37.209 --> 50:38.625
First Dad and now Mom.

50:38.625 --> 50:41.119
What is going on today?

50:41.119 --> 50:42.584
Who are you?

50:42.584 --> 50:45.245
Oh, well...

50:45.245 --> 50:47.000
Mom,

50:47.000 --> 50:50.458
this is my boyfriend.

50:50.458 --> 50:51.838
And this is my mom.

50:51.838 --> 50:53.333
- Hello.
- Oh, yeah.

50:53.333 --> 50:54.699
He was just heading out.

50:54.699 --> 50:57.007
- You'd better get going.
- What? But right now...

50:57.007 --> 50:58.459
Oh right, you're busy.

50:58.459 --> 50:59.721
- Hurry up.
- What...

50:59.721 --> 51:01.841
Off you go.

51:01.841 --> 51:03.899
Let's get inside. I'm so tired.

51:03.899 --> 51:05.333
- Get home safely.
- Bye.

51:05.333 --> 51:06.499
All right, take care.

51:06.499 --> 51:08.258
- I'll see you again soon.
- Sure.

51:08.258 --> 51:09.867
Yes.

51:17.250 --> 51:18.778
I need to rest.

51:18.778 --> 51:21.082
You've been...

51:21.082 --> 51:24.173
seeing someone?

51:24.173 --> 51:27.955
Well... We met on a blind date.

51:27.955 --> 51:29.223
It hasn't been long.

51:29.223 --> 51:32.584
I meant to bring it up,
but you looked occupied.

51:32.584 --> 51:34.483
Plus I didn't know if you'd be curious.

51:34.483 --> 51:36.182
Of course I am.

51:36.182 --> 51:39.902
After all those blind dates,
he's the one you chose.

51:39.902 --> 51:43.311
Don't tell me it's that flashy spender.

51:45.333 --> 51:47.500
It is?

51:47.500 --> 51:51.072
If you're seeing someone,
pick a man who has it together.

51:51.072 --> 51:53.971
Mom, that was a complete mix-up.

51:53.971 --> 51:56.250
Tae Seop isn't a flashy spender,

51:56.250 --> 51:58.785
and he's truly a great guy.

51:59.625 --> 52:01.238
- For real?
- Yeah.

52:01.238 --> 52:03.949
Then have him come by so I can meet him.

52:03.949 --> 52:05.512
What for?

52:05.512 --> 52:07.917
I want to know what caught his eye about you.

52:07.917 --> 52:10.912
Plus I've always had a good read on people.

52:10.912 --> 52:12.603
You do?

52:15.417 --> 52:18.645
- You actually mean it?
- Yeah.

52:18.645 --> 52:22.343
Set a date and tell me.
I'm not saying this lightly.

52:22.343 --> 52:25.345
Got it.

52:25.345 --> 52:26.597
I'm stepping out to the store.

52:26.597 --> 52:28.310
Okay.

52:34.274 --> 52:37.295
She's asking me to bring you home.

52:37.295 --> 52:38.893
Isn't that too much?

52:38.893 --> 52:41.156
No, that's okay with me.

52:41.156 --> 52:44.882
I was so caught off guard before,
I barely managed a hello.

52:44.882 --> 52:47.250
It wouldn't feel right
if I officially greeted your dad

52:47.250 --> 52:49.664
but not your mother.

52:49.664 --> 52:53.273
Oh, that part is true.

52:53.273 --> 52:55.894
What about next Saturday then?

52:55.894 --> 52:57.333
Sure, Saturday's good.

52:57.333 --> 52:59.154
What are your mother's favorites?

52:59.154 --> 53:01.584
Oh, her?

53:01.584 --> 53:03.083
The thing is,

53:03.083 --> 53:07.311
what she loves most of all is alcohol.

53:07.917 --> 53:09.791
Alcohol...

53:09.791 --> 53:14.011
Then maybe bring flowers?
That's her second favorite.

53:14.011 --> 53:15.771
Oh, all right.

53:15.771 --> 53:17.333
I can do that.

53:17.333 --> 53:18.711
Thank you.

53:18.711 --> 53:20.362
Yeah.

53:23.091 --> 53:24.832
Alcohol...

53:46.410 --> 53:50.062
Have a look inside your bag.

53:58.793 --> 54:00.690
Being with you was truly special.

54:00.690 --> 54:03.659
Let's share a love like the sea.

54:12.160 --> 54:16.547
[Dinner with Mom and Tae Seop]

54:18.583 --> 54:20.833
[Dinner with Mom and Tae Seop]

54:25.174 --> 54:27.709
- Hey, it's been a while.
- Oh, hello.

54:27.709 --> 54:28.744
Did you rest well?

54:28.744 --> 54:32.003
Yes, I recharged so well
thanks to your consideration.

54:32.003 --> 54:35.125
The gift set's finalized,
no more changes needed.

54:35.125 --> 54:38.004
For everything else,
refer to the meeting notes.

54:38.004 --> 54:39.183
Understood.

54:39.183 --> 54:41.958
Oh, and during the team manager's leave,

54:41.958 --> 54:45.235
I'm serving as team leader. You knew?

54:45.235 --> 54:48.542
Feel free to call me Manager Jung.

54:48.542 --> 54:49.792
Let's push through together.

54:49.792 --> 54:51.396
Yes.

54:52.000 --> 54:54.250
Manager Jung.

54:54.250 --> 54:55.263
Oh, Mrs. Na Ri.

54:55.263 --> 54:57.122
Those glasses? Do they have a prescription?

54:57.122 --> 54:58.623
They sure do.

54:58.623 --> 55:00.633
Let's do our best.

55:07.792 --> 55:12.270
She seems to be loving
the whole acting leader role.

55:17.792 --> 55:19.895
Is something bothering you?

55:19.895 --> 55:22.226
What's with that expression?

55:22.226 --> 55:27.584
My mother accidentally spotted me
with Tae Seop.

55:27.584 --> 55:30.906
And she told me to bring him to the house.

55:30.906 --> 55:33.007
Isn't that how every parent reacts?

55:33.007 --> 55:34.375
She must be quite impressed.

55:34.375 --> 55:35.727
Typical parents, sure.

55:35.727 --> 55:37.917
But my mom doesn't do that.

55:37.917 --> 55:40.089
It's completely unlike her.

55:42.917 --> 55:44.709
What is it?

55:52.264 --> 55:53.893
Park Jeong Im.

55:53.893 --> 55:55.771
Yes.

56:00.250 --> 56:02.632
I recently had a health checkup,

56:02.632 --> 56:07.283
and the MRI results showed
a suspected cerebral aneurysm.

56:08.876 --> 56:11.822
Have you experienced any head pain or vertigo?

56:11.822 --> 56:16.034
No, nothing out of the ordinary.

56:16.034 --> 56:17.661
No hereditary factors either.

56:17.661 --> 56:20.215
The truth is, most cases present no signs.

56:20.215 --> 56:22.833
It's frequently detected
through exams like yours,

56:22.833 --> 56:25.736
or found after it bursts
and triggers bleeding in the brain.

56:25.736 --> 56:27.125
Bleeding in the brain?

56:27.125 --> 56:28.436
That's the most extreme outcome.

56:28.436 --> 56:30.882
Danger varies by size and location,

56:30.882 --> 56:32.762
so we should do a thorough scan.

56:32.762 --> 56:35.387
In the meantime, make sure you rest well,

56:35.387 --> 56:38.647
and steer clear of drinking,
cigarettes, and stressful situations.

56:38.647 --> 56:40.245
Understood.

56:46.417 --> 56:47.958
Hey.

56:47.958 --> 56:49.575
Hey?

56:50.277 --> 56:52.406
- Hey!
- Yeah.

56:52.406 --> 56:53.533
You went to see the doctor?

56:53.533 --> 56:54.772
What was the verdict?

56:54.772 --> 56:56.324
Well...

56:56.324 --> 56:58.417
They want to do further testing.

57:01.292 --> 57:03.248
Does your daughter know?

57:03.248 --> 57:04.741
No.

57:04.741 --> 57:08.001
I'll share it after I get the actual results.

57:08.001 --> 57:11.462
Her boyfriend's coming over this week too.

57:11.462 --> 57:13.050
Your girl has a boyfriend?

57:13.050 --> 57:14.846
You told me she was
just doing blind dates nonstop.

57:14.846 --> 57:17.978
I walked right in on them together.

57:19.750 --> 57:21.110
I just wondered

57:21.110 --> 57:25.121
if he was a good man,
so I invited them for dinner.

57:25.121 --> 57:27.242
But you should let her know quickly.

57:27.242 --> 57:28.856
If she hears later, it'll hit her hard.

57:28.856 --> 57:30.556
At least your coverage is in order.

57:30.556 --> 57:32.268
It's not about the finances,

57:32.268 --> 57:34.536
I just feel bad burdening her with this.

57:34.536 --> 57:36.489
If I had someone by my side,

57:36.489 --> 57:40.455
I wouldn't have to pile everything on my child.

57:40.455 --> 57:42.962
What about letting your husband know?

57:44.250 --> 57:47.000
Husband? Give me a break.

57:47.000 --> 57:48.547
It's been 20 years of separate lives.

57:48.547 --> 57:50.670
I'll tough it out on my own.

57:50.670 --> 57:54.466
I'm never leaning on that man.

57:54.466 --> 57:57.518
Yeah. That sounds about right.

58:13.794 --> 58:15.709
Did someone turn this into a steam room?

58:15.709 --> 58:18.239
With all those deep breaths.

58:18.239 --> 58:21.117
The whole room's feeling heavy.

58:21.117 --> 58:22.118
Well, it's just...

58:22.118 --> 58:24.749
I'm eating with Ui Yeong's mom this weekend.

58:24.749 --> 58:27.034
Hold on, you're already at that point?

58:27.034 --> 58:28.473
That's quick.

58:28.473 --> 58:30.627
Let me share how I charmed

58:30.627 --> 58:34.172
my way through with my mother-in-law.

58:34.172 --> 58:35.748
Tell me.

58:35.748 --> 58:39.309
It's kind of like a first date, yet it's not.

58:39.309 --> 58:41.125
Rather than truly impressing her,

58:41.125 --> 58:43.765
it's the visible attempt
to impress that counts.

58:43.765 --> 58:44.792
The attempt.

58:44.792 --> 58:47.458
To a mother-in-law,
that sincerity is what's charming.

58:47.458 --> 58:48.537
Right.

58:48.537 --> 58:51.735
I prepared her favorite flowers
and picked out clothes.

58:51.735 --> 58:53.625
Watch me.

58:53.625 --> 58:56.653
"I picked up the flowers you like

58:56.653 --> 58:59.208
and put this on for you.
I hope it meets your standards."

58:59.208 --> 59:00.991
That sort of thing.

59:00.991 --> 59:03.702
- Wouldn't being straightforward work better?
- Absolutely not.

59:03.702 --> 59:05.051
"I picked up the flowers you like

59:05.051 --> 59:06.834
and put this on for you.
I hope it meets your standards."

59:06.834 --> 59:08.665
That has zero impact.

59:08.665 --> 59:10.791
The point is showing you tried. Understand?

59:10.791 --> 59:11.963
- Really?
- You're completely clueless.

59:11.963 --> 59:13.375
- Then what's next?
- The effort.

59:13.375 --> 59:15.880
But my liver isn't ready for this.

59:15.880 --> 59:17.895
She apparently loves to drink.

59:17.895 --> 59:19.458
That calls for hangover pills.

59:19.458 --> 59:21.556
Better down two before you go.

59:21.556 --> 59:22.876
- Two?
- Yeah.

59:22.876 --> 59:25.333
If you loosen up a bit,
make sure it doesn't show.

59:25.333 --> 59:27.709
Respond enthusiastically
to whatever her mom says.

59:27.709 --> 59:30.167
And don't just fumble
past things out of shyness.

59:30.167 --> 59:32.622
Respond nice and strong.

59:32.622 --> 59:34.398
- Strong?
- With those big sincere blinks.

59:34.398 --> 59:35.623
Yes!

59:35.623 --> 59:37.041
- Loud and clear.
- I don't think that's it.

59:37.041 --> 59:38.849
Yeah, that's not it.

59:40.417 --> 59:42.206
Okay.

59:51.750 --> 59:54.002
Oh, come on.

59:54.002 --> 59:56.625
You should keep it this way every day.

59:56.625 --> 01:00:00.349
The surface is about to come clean off.

01:00:16.024 --> 01:00:20.000
Why are you stuffing things out of sight?
We need all of that.

01:00:20.000 --> 01:00:22.635
A house should have
a bit of character and mess.

01:00:22.635 --> 01:00:24.932
He doesn't need to see all of that tonight.

01:00:24.932 --> 01:00:25.958
What?

01:00:25.958 --> 01:00:29.616
Also, Mom, no tough questions tonight, okay?

01:00:29.616 --> 01:00:32.336
And don't just throw words around either.

01:00:32.336 --> 01:00:34.136
Be gentle and kind.

01:00:34.136 --> 01:00:36.458
Okay? Just like this.

01:00:36.458 --> 01:00:38.463
- Good enough?
- Yeah.

01:00:38.463 --> 01:00:40.973
That face should've been your everyday look.

01:00:41.800 --> 01:00:45.125
Mom, did you not make anything?

01:00:45.125 --> 01:00:48.320
Cooking it myself would've been insulting.

01:00:48.320 --> 01:00:49.686
The menu's already been decided.

01:00:49.686 --> 01:00:51.143
What's that?

01:00:52.833 --> 01:00:54.437
Oh, I need to order now.

01:00:54.437 --> 01:00:56.841
- Does he have any food allergies?
- No, he eats everything.

01:00:56.841 --> 01:00:59.374
- Then I'll get the boiled beef hot pot.
- Fine.

01:00:59.374 --> 01:01:01.402
- Where did my phone go?
- Oh, this towel.

01:01:01.402 --> 01:01:04.292
Put it in properly, honestly.

01:01:04.292 --> 01:01:06.498
And the water, seriously.

01:01:08.917 --> 01:01:11.003
I need to hide the alcohol.

01:01:30.667 --> 01:01:32.524
Oh, right.

01:01:50.035 --> 01:01:51.096
He got here fast.

01:01:51.096 --> 01:01:53.056
Mom, I think Tae Seop's here.

01:01:53.056 --> 01:01:54.713
Okay.

01:02:01.876 --> 01:02:03.597
Dad.

01:02:06.843 --> 01:02:08.828
Hey, sweetheart.

01:02:24.506 --> 01:02:27.121
It's been a while.

01:02:45.625 --> 01:02:47.349
Ui Yeong.

01:02:48.625 --> 01:02:50.322
Tae Seop.

01:02:51.333 --> 01:02:53.514
You're here too?

01:02:53.514 --> 01:02:56.066
- Come on in.
- Oh, yes.

01:03:00.391 --> 01:03:01.397
- Hello.
- Oh, yes.

01:03:01.397 --> 01:03:03.320
Seeing how we keep crossing paths like this,

01:03:03.320 --> 01:03:07.581
you must be fated
to be part of this family for good.

01:03:47.944 --> 01:03:51.663
[Date with Tae Seop]

01:04:00.794 --> 01:04:04.864
[Let's share a love like the sea]

01:04:08.840 --> 01:04:12.935
[Let's be together tonight]

01:04:14.220 --> 01:04:16.603
[I'll do my best to make Ui Yeong happy]
It wasn't just you meeting Tae Seop.

01:04:16.603 --> 01:04:19.100
It was also Tae Seop meeting you.

01:04:19.100 --> 01:04:20.983
I'm truly fine.

01:04:20.983 --> 01:04:23.041
Today just wasn't the day.

01:04:23.041 --> 01:04:25.523
How about staying here for a while?

01:04:25.523 --> 01:04:26.562
Ui Yeong!

01:04:26.562 --> 01:04:29.235
How are you two commuting together?

01:04:29.235 --> 01:04:30.487
Ji Su.

01:04:30.487 --> 01:04:33.021
How do you two know each other?

01:04:33.021 --> 01:04:35.542
Are you outside right now?

01:04:35.542 --> 01:04:37.911
What do you mean, a writer?

01:04:37.911 --> 01:04:39.151
Mom!

01:04:39.151 --> 01:04:40.167
Mom!

01:04:40.167 --> 01:04:42.125
She collapsed

01:04:42.125 --> 01:04:44.208
right in front of me.

01:04:44.208 --> 01:04:46.804
This is all because of me.
